  "memory": {
    "claim": "user_fact",
    "conditions": "仅适用于 MacBook 上从 MonoProxy/8118 切换到 Clash Verge/7897 的清理过程。",
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "content": "2026-10-18，用户的 MacBook 联网故障被定位为三层旧代理问题：MonoProxy 的 LaunchAgent 保活脚本会写回 8118、shell 配置（~/.zshrc、~/.zprofile）export 了 8118、Wi-Fi 系统代理也指向旧代理；用户在终端执行了清理：把 mono 保活 plist 移到 ~/Library/LaunchAgents-disabled、删除两个 shell 文件里的 8118 行，并把 Clash Verge 的 enable_system_proxy 改为 true 后重启 Verge。",
    "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:36:13.508000Z",
    "derived_from": [],
    "entities": [
      "ent_f90a16b26a8ab1d551fc",
      "ent_938e46918a00d3c0f0f5",
      "ent_c42dac5ae99195f63d24"
    ],
    "epistemic": "observed",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "event_id": "evt_21f5a5863fc6f61fded0",
        "quote": "mv ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.seancao.monoproxy-ensure.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents-disabled/",
        "revision": 1,
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "evt_21f5a5863fc6f61fded0",
        "quote": "sed -i '' '/8118/d' ~/.zshrc ~/.zprofile",
        "revision": 1,
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "evt_21f5a5863fc6f61fded0",
        "quote": "mono 保活脚本已挪走 ✅ - shell 里的 8118 已删 ✅",
        "revision": 1,
        "role": "assistant"
      }
    ],
